## Why This Is Asked
The new angle tests practical budgeting under load: how privacy budgets govern when DP noise is applied and when fast heuristics must be used, with per-tenant isolation.

## Key Concepts
- Per-user privacy budgets and token-bucket refills
- Adaptive scoring paths and deterministic fallbacks
- Tenant isolation and budget accounting
- Conversational testing for budget enforcement

## Code Example
```javascript
// Mock budget check
function canSpend(userId, needed, store) {
  const remaining = store.getBudget(userId);
  if (remaining >= needed) {
    store.setBudget(userId, remaining - needed);
    return true;
  }
  return false;
}
```

